doctype html
html(lang='en')
  head
    meta(charset='utf-8')
    meta(name='viewport' content='width=device-width, initial-scale=1')
    meta(name='csrf-token' content=csrfToken)
    title TARIC request history and review
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/color-theme.css')
    link(rel='stylesheet' href='/css/taric-history.css')
    script(src='/js/taric-history.js' defer)
  body
    main
      nav
        a(href='/admin/taric') TARIC manager / JSON inspection
        a(href='/admin/taric/history/guide') Review & dataset guide
        button#theme(type='button') Toggle light / dark
      h1 Request history & human review
      p Request → predictor proposal → final human choice → independent label review. Benchmark attempts are excluded. Times and date boundaries are UTC.
      p Verification is your attestation, not software validation of legal TARIC classification. It cannot enable production, publish a benchmark or approve training.
      p#status(role='status' aria-live='polite') Loading request history…
      form#filters
        h2 Filters
        .fields
          each field in [{name:'from',label:'From date (UTC)',type:'date'},{name:'to',label:'Through date (UTC)',type:'date'},{name:'jan',label:'JAN (exact)'},{name:'code',label:'Final or reviewed TARIC (10 digits)'},{name:'adapter',label:'Adapter (exact)'},{name:'error',label:'Error code (exact)'},{name:'batch',label:'Local batch ID (exact)'},{name:'search',label:'Category / full name (literal text)'}]
            label
              span= field.label
              input(name=field.name type=field.type || 'text' maxlength='100')
          each field in [{name:'mode',label:'Mode',values:['test','normal']},{name:'state',label:'Request status',values:['queued','running','complete','failed','interrupted','cancelled']},{name:'feedback',label:'Final feedback',values:['present','absent','accepted','changed','manual']},{name:'review',label:'Review status',values:['unreviewed','verified','needs_review','excluded']},{name:'missing',label:'Has missing item data (no captured name)',values:['yes','no']},{name:'reprocess',label:'Latest local re-do',values:['enriched','model_failed']},{name:'eligible',label:'Candidate eligible',values:['yes','no']}]
            label
              span= field.label
              select(name=field.name)
                option(value='') All
                each value in field.values
                  option(value=value)= value
        button(type='submit') Apply filters
        a(href='/admin/taric/history') Clear filters
      section(aria-labelledby='stats-heading')
        h2#stats-heading Usage in filtered population
        p Feedback decision shares use final feedback as denominator; they are not model accuracy. Verified-but-ineligible includes stale verified revisions.
        #stats.cards
      section(aria-labelledby='local-heading')
        h2#local-heading Filtered JAN export & local enrichment
        p Both actions use all matching pages (up to 2,000 filtered cases), not the 50 shown. JAN export does not require verification or candidate eligibility.
        button#jan-preview(type='button') Preview filtered JAN export
        button#jan-download(type='button' disabled) Download JAN CSV
        p Import the CSV column as TEXT to preserve leading zeros. The download contains literal JAN strings with header jan; no spreadsheet formulas.
        #jan-content(role='status' aria-live='polite')
        p First import items using your separate manual import workflow. There is no importer here. Preview checks the local AmiAmi database only. Verified and excluded records are protected; missing/ambiguous items are reported without starting a GPU.
        button#redo-preview(type='button') Preview local re-do
        #redo-content(role='status' aria-live='polite')
        label.check
          input#redo-confirm(type='checkbox')
          span I want test predictions for these local cases. No feedback code changes; local database facts only; no external app call. Manual review and separate description approval remain required; test predictions may be wrong.
        button#redo-start(type='button' disabled) Reprocess filtered entries
        section#batch-progress(hidden aria-labelledby='batch-heading')
          h3#batch-heading Local batch progress
          #batch-content(role='status' aria-live='polite')
          button#batch-refresh(type='button') Refresh progress
          button#batch-cancel(type='button') Cancel future cases
          a#batch-history(href='/admin/taric/history') Review enriched cases
          p Cancel stops future cases. It does not force GPU cancellation or roll back saved facts. If admission is busy, release your own manual reservation in its existing control and preview a new batch; this tool never takes another reservation.
      section(aria-labelledby='requests-heading')
        h2#requests-heading Requests
        #requests
        button#next(type='button' hidden) Next 50 requests
      section#detail(hidden aria-labelledby='detail-heading' tabindex='-1')
        h2#detail-heading Request detail & review
        #detail-content
        form#review-form
          h3 Explicit human review
          p The target defaults to the actual final feedback. Without feedback, only an accepted suggestion can be explicitly confirmed. Rejected diagnostics are never a default target.
          .fields
            label
              span Review status
              select#review-status
                option(value='verified') Verified label
                option(value='needs_review') Needs review / withdraw verification
                option(value='excluded') Excluded
                option(value='unreviewed') Unreviewed
            label
              span Review target TARIC (10 digits)
              input#review-target(type='text' inputmode='numeric' pattern='[0-9]{10}' maxlength='10')
          label.check
            input#confirm-target(type='checkbox')
            span I independently verified this exact target against the displayed source snapshot.
          label.check
            input#correction(type='checkbox')
            span This is a training-label correction; the original final human choice stays unchanged. My note identifies the reason/source.
          label
            span Independently approved short description (optional; blank means not approved)
            textarea#approved-description(maxlength='255' rows='2')
          label
            span Review note / verification source / withdrawal reason (required)
            textarea#review-note(maxlength='2000' rows='3' required)
          button#save-review(type='submit') Save explicit review revision
      section(aria-labelledby='export-heading')
        h2#export-heading Prepare reviewed source candidates
        p Code-only candidate profile. Full item name, descriptive category and original HS6 are required; specifications may be missing. An approved description is optional here. Use the linked guide and offline converter to create Qwen CSVs from complete sources with explicitly approved descriptions. Grouped splits and training are separate manual steps.
        p Exact normalized input duplicates keep the latest review. Disagreeing current labels within a JAN or identical input group are blocked, including records hidden by filters. Independent published holdout identities are excluded where known. No semantic near-duplicate guarantee.
        .fields
          label
            span Selection order
            select#selection-mode
              option(value='newest') Newest verified first
              option(value='balanced') Balanced by TARIC
          label
            span Overall row limit (1–200)
            input#selection-limit(type='number' min='1' max='200' value='100')
          label
            span Per-code cap (1–100)
            input#selection-cap(type='number' min='1' max='100' value='20')
        button#preview(type='button') Preview current filters
        button#download(type='button' disabled) Freeze manifest & download JSONL
        #preview-content(role='status' aria-live='polite')
      footer
        p Private, no analytics. Existing requests and feedback expire after 90 days. User-started local revision facts (including unreviewed facts), original snapshots, batch records, verified source snapshots, review audits and frozen exports persist until operator deletion. Archives without a final feedback binding are ineligible. Narrow dates/JAN/mode/status if the pilot limit is reached. Pilot limit: 2,000 filtered live + archived cases; 50 per page. Export maximum: 200 rows / 8 MiB.
